    "html": "<section data-deck-active data-label=\"Intelligence\" data-screen-label=\"09\" data-speaker-notes=\"Every verified outcome, every blocked action, every approval decision feeds GIBE, Gravitre's learning engine. Over time it learns which actions are safe to run autonomously in your business and which genuinely need a human. That's a compounding advantage competitors can't replicate quickly.\" style=\"background:#f4f6f5;overflow:hidden\">\n  <div style=\"position:relative;width:100%;height:100%;font-family:var(--font-primary)\"><div style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;background-image:radial-gradient(rgba(23,22,20,0.055) 1px,transparent 1px);background-size:32px 32px;pointer-events:none\"></div>\n    <div style=\"position:absolute;width:700px;height:700px;border-radius:50%;background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(22,163,116,0.12),transparent 70%);top:-200px;left:-180px;filter:blur(50px);animation:gv-pulse 7.5s ease-in-out infinite;pointer-events:none\"></div>\n    <div style=\"position:absolute;top:60px;left:140px;right:140px;height:1px;background:rgba(23,22,20,0.12)\"></div><div style=\"position:absolute;top:60px;left:140px;width:120px;height:3px;background:#16a374\"></div><div style=\"position:absolute;bottom:0;left:0;width:100%;height:4px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#16a374,rgba(22,163,116,0.15) 45%,rgba(22,163,116,0))\"></div>\n    <div style=\"position:absolute;top:76px;left:140px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px\"><div style=\"width:10px;height:10px;background:#16a374\"></div><div style=\"font-size:24px;letter-spacing:3px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#0f5132;font-weight:600\">04 · Intelligence</div><div style=\"width:64px;height:1px;background:rgba(22,163,116,0.45)\"></div></div>\n    <div style=\"position:absolute;top:80px;right:140px;font-size:24px;color:rgba(23,22,20,0.55);letter-spacing:1px\">09 / 17</div>\n\n    <div style=\"position:absolute;left:140px;top:190px;right:140px;bottom:110px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:90px;align-items:center\">\n      <div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:60px;font-weight:600;color:#171614;line-height:1.14;letter-spacing:-1.5px\">The platform gets smarter about your business, not just smarter in general.</div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:28px;color:rgba(23,22,20,0.68);line-height:1.55;margin-top:36px\">Every verified outcome, blocked action, and approval decision feeds GIBE — Gravitre's learning engine. It learns what's safe to automate in <em>your</em> business specifically.</div>\n        <div style=\"margin-top:36px;padding-left:26px;border-left:3px solid #16a374;font-size:26px;color:#0f5132;font-weight:600\">A compounding advantage competitors can't replicate quickly.</div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"position:relative;height:560px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n        <div style=\"position:absolute;width:460px;height:460px;border:1px dashed rgba(22,163,116,0.35);border-radius:50%;animation:gv-orbit 40s linear infinite\"></div>\n        <div style=\"width:280px;height:280px;border-radius:50%;background:#16a374;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;box-shadow:0 0 60px rgba(22,163,116,0.28)\">\n          <div style=\"font-size:56px;font-weight:700;color:#0b1f17;letter-spacing:-1px\">GIBE</div>\n          <div style=\"font-size:24px;color:#0b1f17;margin-top:8px;text-align:center;max-width:210px;line-height:1.3\">Gravitre's learning engine</div>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"position:absolute;top:6px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);width:300px;text-align:center;font-size:24px;color:#171614;background:#f7f6f4;border:1px solid rgba(23,22,20,0.14);border-radius:10px;padding:14px 18px\">Verified outcomes</div>\n        <div style=\"position:absolute;bottom:96px;right:-10px;width:250px;text-align:center;font-size:24px;color:#171614;background:#f7f6f4;border:1px solid rgba(23,22,20,0.14);border-radius:10px;padding:14px 18px\">Blocked actions</div>\n        <div style=\"position:absolute;bottom:96px;left:-10px;width:250px;text-align:center;font-size:24px;color:#171614;background:#f7f6f4;border:1px solid rgba(23,22,20,0.14);border-radius:10px;padding:14px 18px\">Approval decisions</div>\n        <div style=\"position:absolute;bottom:0;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);width:400px;text-align:center;font-size:24px;color:#0f5132;border:1px solid rgba(22,163,116,0.45);border-radius:10px;padding:14px 18px\">Knows what's safe to automate</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>"
