    "label": "Product",
    "screen": "10",
    "notes": "Governed multi-agent chat with real connector actions across a 600+ action catalog. Meson, the visual AI-assisted workflow builder that flags what's broken before it runs. A real-time voice agent, natural conversation, not IVR menus. A browser extension carrying the same governance into the tools your team already lives in. One shared interface across web, desktop, and extension.",
    "html": "<section data-deck-active data-label=\"Product\" data-screen-label=\"10\" data-speaker-notes=\"Governed multi-agent chat with real connector actions across a 600+ action catalog. Meson, the visual AI-assisted workflow builder that flags what's broken before it runs. A real-time voice agent, natural conversation, not IVR menus. A browser extension carrying the same governance into the tools your team already lives in. One shared interface across web, desktop, and extension.\" style=\"background:#ffffff;overflow:hidden\">\n  <div style=\"position:relative;width:100%;height:100%;font-family:var(--font-primary)\"><div style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;background-image:radial-gradient(rgba(23,22,20,0.055) 1px,transparent 1px);background-size:32px 32px;pointer-events:none\"></div>\n    <div style=\"position:absolute;top:60px;left:140px;right:140px;height:1px;background:rgba(23,22,20,0.12)\"></div><div style=\"position:absolute;top:60px;left:140px;width:120px;height:3px;background:#16a374\"></div><div style=\"position:absolute;bottom:0;left:0;width:100%;height:4px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#16a374,rgba(22,163,116,0.15) 45%,rgba(22,163,116,0))\"></div>\n    <div style=\"position:absolute;top:76px;left:140px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px\"><div style=\"width:10px;height:10px;background:#16a374\"></div><div style=\"font-size:24px;letter-spacing:3px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#0f5132;font-weight:600\">Product</div><div style=\"width:64px;height:1px;background:rgba(22,163,116,0.45)\"></div></div>\n    <div style=\"position:absolute;top:80px;right:140px;font-size:24px;color:rgba(23,22,20,0.55);letter-spacing:1px\">10 / 17</div>\n\n    <div style=\"position:absolute;left:140px;top:180px;right:140px;bottom:100px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;gap:48px\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:flex-end;justify-content:space-between;gap:60px\">\n        <div style=\"font-size:62px;font-weight:600;color:#171614;letter-spacing:-1.5px;line-height:1.12\">Four surfaces.<br>One governed system.</div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:26px;color:rgba(23,22,20,0.68);max-width:540px;text-align:right;line-height:1.5\">Governed multi-agent chat across a 600+ action catalog, with the same rules on every surface.</div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:26px\">\n        <div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px\">\n          <img src=\"/deck-assets/58740ae3-a52d-462b-a95d-b79a48a21e8c.png\" style=\"width:100%;aspect-ratio:1.6/1;object-fit:cover;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 14px 34px rgba(23,22,20,0.12);border:1px solid rgba(23,22,20,0.14)\" alt=\"Meson\">\n          <div style=\"font-size:28px;color:#171614;font-weight:600\">Meson</div>\n          <div style=\"font-size:24px;color:rgba(23,22,20,0.66);line-height:1.4\">AI-assisted workflow builder that flags what's broken before it runs</div>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px\">\n          <img src=\"/deck-assets/d464ce56-acde-4cb1-abe4-4f5ea250c29a.png\" style=\"width:100%;aspect-ratio:1.6/1;object-fit:cover;object-position:center 30%;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 14px 34px rgba(23,22,20,0.12);border:1px solid rgba(23,22,20,0.14)\" alt=\"Voice agent\">\n          <div style=\"font-size:28px;color:#171614;font-weight:600\">Voice agent</div>\n          <div style=\"font-size:24px;color:rgba(23,22,20,0.66);line-height:1.4\">Real-time conversation, full preset and custom voice library</div>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px\">\n          <img src=\"/deck-assets/d8099bb9-e662-448b-a0bb-520497f40a5a.png\" style=\"width:100%;aspect-ratio:1.6/1;object-fit:cover;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 14px 34px rgba(23,22,20,0.12);border:1px solid rgba(23,22,20,0.14)\" alt=\"Browser extension\">\n          <div style=\"font-size:28px;color:#171614;font-weight:600\">Browser extension</div>\n          <div style=\"font-size:24px;color:rgba(23,22,20,0.66);line-height:1.4\">The same governance inside the tools your team already lives in</div>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px\">\n          <img src=\"/deck-assets/7cbadb13-4a3c-4e86-8150-ee59d1422184.png\" style=\"width:100%;aspect-ratio:1.6/1;object-fit:cover;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 14px 34px rgba(23,22,20,0.12);border:1px solid rgba(23,22,20,0.14)\" alt=\"One interface\">\n          <div style=\"font-size:28px;color:#171614;font-weight:600\">One interface</div>\n          <div style=\"font-size:24px;color:rgba(23,22,20,0.66);line-height:1.4\">Web, desktop, and extension — not three different products</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>"
